op&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7a17c315f40409e43a4cd5ac884536f8 3x"}, "body": "Hello, sensei!! May I request an illustration? The character is a mage who pursues knowledge at all costs. He made a pact with a demon to gain knowledge. Evil and manipulative. \n\nHe is a man with a dark and mysterious energy. Please draw him casting a spell. When he casts spells, blood-red runes appear in the air in a circle. Here are some reference ideas: https://imgur.com/a/JJ531Lt The runes are in a strange, flowing handwriting. Lots of runes close together, like it was written by someone with dense handwriting. I'm sorry if my explanation is poor. If it's difficult to understand, please just draw it as you see fit. I will be happy with anything sensei draws!\n\nPlease put any text on a separate layer in the PSD that can be turned on and off.\n\nThank you very much for considering my request!! (I am very sorry if the machine translation is rude.)\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/XzwaIGt", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "sent_works": [{"path": "/@_irur/works/27", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1146927, "client_id": 2057227, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/adc75aa9/uploads/origins/71e948d9-1128-40b6-bfd6-3a27a62c3315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a8a6e912880e2c7f2555f3dac9b2995", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/adc75aa9/uploads/origins/71e948d9-1128-40b6-bfd6-3a27a62c3315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1a8a6e912880e2c7f2555f3dac9b2995, https://si.imgix.net/adc75aa9/uploads/origins/71e948d9-1128-40b6-bfd6-3a27a62c3315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=932ee307b353b24e4d35968e9d628b2f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/adc75aa9/uploads/origins/71e948d9-1128-40b6-bfd6-3a27a62c3315?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompr